@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fix confusing assertion rewriting messages when comparing ``bytes`` objects,
+which used to be reported as sequences of integer byte values. Bytes are now
+shown as one-byte ``bytes`` objects (for example ``b's' != b'e'``).
